  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Supporting Korean Language Education and Digital Education Transformation in Vietnamese Secondary Schools Using an AI-Powered EdTech Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Korean Language Education in Secondary Schools through the Deployment of the AI Powered EdTech PlatformThe project introduces the AI Powered EdTech Platform to secondary schools in provincial regions of Vietnam as a foundation for delivering Korean language education.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote the digital transformation of public education system by introducing an AI powered EdTech platform, starting with Korean language education. By leveraging Korean language education as a strategic entry point, the project seeks to expand EdTech infrastructure to enhance educational equity.1. &#xc911;&#xace0;&#xad50; &#xd559;&#xad50; &#xc218;&#xc5c5;&#xc758; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc804;&#xd658; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; 2. &#xc911;&#xace0;&#xad50; &#xd55c;&#xad6d;&#xc5b4; &#xd559;&#xc2b5;&#xc131;&#xacfc; &#xbc0f; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xd559;&#xc2b5;&#xacbd;&#xd5d8; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1; 3. &#xad50;&#xc6d0;&#xc758; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xad50;&#xc218;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
